---
// Static figure: "Phở" is 3 runes stored as 5 bytes; range gives rune start positions; s[:3] cuts a rune.
const bytes = [
  { hex: '50', idx: 0 },
  { hex: '68', idx: 1 },
  { hex: 'E1', idx: 2 },
  { hex: 'BB', idx: 3 },
  { hex: '9F', idx: 4 },
];
const X0 = 80;
const CW = 100;
---
<figure class="gsb">
  <div class="gsb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 250" role="img" aria-label="The string Phở is three runes P, h and ở stored as five bytes. The rune ở uses bytes 2, 3 and 4. Cutting at byte 3 leaves a broken half rune.">
      <text x="8" y="76" class="gsb-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>runes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>rune</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="8" y="148" class="gsb-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>bytes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>byte</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="8" y="188" class="gsb-m">index</text>

      <rect x={X0} y="50" width={CW - 4} height="40" rx="6" class="gsb-rune" />
      <text x={X0 + (CW - 4) / 2} y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="gsb-b">P</text>
      <rect x={X0 + CW} y="50" width={CW - 4} height="40" rx="6" class="gsb-rune" />
      <text x={X0 + CW + (CW - 4) / 2} y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="gsb-b">h</text>
      <rect x={X0 + 2 * CW} y="50" width={3 * CW - 4} height="40" rx="6" class="gsb-rune is-wide" />
      <text x={X0 + 2 * CW + (3 * CW - 4) / 2} y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="gsb-b">ở (U+1EDF)</text>

      {bytes.map((b) => (
        <>
          <rect x={X0 + b.idx * CW} y="120" width={CW - 4} height="40" rx="6" class="gsb-byte" />
          <text x={X0 + b.idx * CW + (CW - 4) / 2} y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="gsb-b">0x{b.hex}</text>
          <text x={X0 + b.idx * CW + (CW - 4) / 2} y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="gsb-m">{b.idx}</text>
        </>
      ))}

      <line x1={X0 + 3 * CW - 2} x2={X0 + 3 * CW - 2} y1="112" y2="204" class="gsb-cut" />
      <text x={X0 + 3 * CW - 2} y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="gsb-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>s[:3] stops here: ở keeps 1 of its 3 bytes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>s[:3] dừng ở đây: ở chỉ còn 1 trong 3 byte</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x={X0} y="30" class="gsb-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>len("Phở") = 5 bytes, but only 3 runes. range gives positions 0, 1, 2.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>len("Phở") = 5 byte, nhưng chỉ có 3 rune. range trả vị trí 0, 1, 2.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .gsb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gsb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gsb svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 600px; height: auto; }
  .gsb text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gsb-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gsb-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gsb-m { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gsb-red { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gsb-rune { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gsb-byte { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gsb-cut { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .gsb-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
</style>
